**Review suggestion: Hiroshi Tanaka.** They are the only top owner who has committed in the last year. Also add Santiago Bartesaghi if you want a second active reviewer.

Ranked by surviving lines in `lib/rack/attack/store_proxy/` (277 non-blank lines, 331 with blank lines, 6 files, as of 2026-09-30):

| Person | Lines (share) | Commits | Last commit | Status |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| Hiroshi Tanaka (2 addresses) | 72 (26.0%) | 2 | 2026-09-16 | active |
| hakanensari | 63 (22.7%) | 1 | 2014-04-15 | inactive |
| Gonzalo Rodriguez | 51 (18.4%) | 23 | 2019-08-02 | inactive |
| fatkodima | 22 (7.9%) | 4 | 2019-10-24 | inactive |
| Brad Lindsay | 19 (6.9%) | 1 | 2018-02-06 | inactive |

- **Other authors:** 15 more authors hold about 18% together (my subtraction; the tool doesn't print their share). Santiago Bartesaghi is one of them, with 5 lines (1.8%), last commit 2026-08-04, active.
- **Active only:** "Active" means a commit in the 365 days before 2026-09-30. Only Hiroshi Tanaka and Santiago Bartesaghi qualify. The top three by lines are Hiroshi Tanaka, hakanensari and Gonzalo Rodriguez, but the last two have not committed in years.
- **Hiroshi Tanaka's count is a guess.** It merges `hiroshi@tanaka.example` (59 lines, 1 commit) and `<email redacted>` (13 lines, 1 commit) because the name is the same. Unmerged, hakanensari (63 lines) would rank first and Hiroshi Tanaka would have 59 lines (21.3%). Hiroshi Tanaka is active either way.
- **Bus factor:** 3, meaning the smallest number of authors whose surviving lines reach 50%, computed for this directory only. They hold 67.1% of the lines. Reaching 80% takes 5 authors.

What was left out or checked:
- **Dropped:** the generated `sorbet/rbi/gems/<email redacted>` (149 lines) and the dependabot bot's lines are excluded from the repo-wide numbers. Neither affects this directory's table.
- **Reformat commits:** none were set aside. The tool honored the `.git-blame-ignore-revs` file, which had one commit.
- **Mechanical rewrites:** the tool checked and set aside none. It flagged `20d6682` ("style: fix Lint/HandleExceptions rubocop", Gonzalo Rodriguez, 2 surviving lines) as possibly mechanical but did not set it aside.
- **Copy detection:** figures use `git blame -w -M -C`. hakanensari has 63 lines with copy detection and 66 (23.8%) without. Three lines credited to madlep and one to Rob Watson appear only with it.
- **Duplicate names:** Gonzalo Rodriguez also appears under the name "Gonzalo" on the same address, and madlep also appears as Julian Doherty (madlep). Both are counted as one person each.
- **Identity merges:** I wrote no `.mailmap`, so nothing is saved. The merges above are in memory only.

These numbers say whose code is still there. They say nothing about who understands it now or how good it is.

